      "content": "so i guess i'm stuck then. it's just annoying because it feels like the data is actively resisting the change. like it's some kind of invisible force or something holding onto the old records. is there anything else that causes that kind of \"phantom\" behavior where the old data persists even when everything looks right on my end?",
